  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units that have this ability, other than **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units, gain three abilities:\n\n- **Encircling Jaws**: under the [assault doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines), the unit adds 1 to its **Charge rolls** and **Advance rolls**.\n- **Hunter’s Eye**: under the [devastator doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines), its ranged attacks may re-roll a **[Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** of 1.\n- **Ferocious Strike**: under the [tactical doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines), its attacks targeting enemy units 'with 9\"' of it get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n\nYour **LOGAN GRIMNAR** units gain **Howling Onslaught**, usable by your army once per battle in your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase): your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units then also benefit from **Master of Wolves** until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts.\n\n**Restrictions**: **SPACE WOLVES** units are allowed in your army, but **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from any other Chapter are not.\n\nFerocious Strike's range is printed as 'with 9\"', not 'within 9\"', so which enemy units it covers is open.",
